                  Parameters for VMODEL
                  *********************

START OF PARAMETERS:
vmodel.var   \file for variogram output
3 20   \number of directions and lags
30 -20 1   \azm, dip, lag distance
120 0 1   \azm, dip, lag distance
75 45 0.75   \azm, dip, lag distance
2 0.1   \nst, nugget effect
1 0.6 30 -20 10   \it,cc,ang1,ang2,ang3
20 8 4   \a_hmax, a_hmin, a_vert
2 0.3 120 0 0   \it,cc,ang1,ang2,ang3
15 10 5   \a_hmax, a_hmin, a_vert
